{"lyrics":"[Chorus]\n[00:12.74]From the unknown\n[00:15.76]I ran away, I don't think I'm coming back home\n[00:19.36]Woah-woah-woah-woah-woah-woah\n[00:22.04]Like a crawlspace, it's a dark place I roam\n[00:25.18]Ain't no right way, just the wrong way I know\n[00:28.48]I problem-solve with Styrofoam\n[00:31.36]My world revolves around a black hole\n[00:34.60]The same black hole that's in place of my soul, uh\n[00:37.98]Empty, I feel so goddamn empty\n[00:42.24]I may go rogue\n[00:43.80]Don't tempt me, big bullet holes\n[00:46.86]Tote semi-autos\n[Verse 1]\n[00:50.38]Huh, yeah\n[00:50.78]I'm keepin' it real, real\n[00:52.14]I'm keepin' it real, uh, yeah\n[00:54.16]Life gets tough, shit is getting real (Yeah)\n[00:56.94]I don't know how to feel\n[00:58.44]Swallowing all these pills\n[01:00.04]Numb my real feels, uh\n[01:01.52]Devil standing here\n[01:03.06]Tryna' make a deal, uh\n[01:04.56]It ain't no deals\n[01:05.38]Feel like I'm going crazy, but still took a lot to get me here\n[01:08.52]Losing my sanity up in a house in the hills, hills, hills\n[01:11.20]I ain't have vanity then and I still don't have vanity still, still, still, uh\n[01:15.08]Bein' me, I rock, PnB\n[01:17.42]These hoes actin' like gossip, TMZ\n[01:20.52]These drugs acting like mosh pits squishing me\n[01:23.68]Oh my, oh me, how they kill me slowly\n[01:27.48]Lonely, I been gettin' no peace\n[01:30.66]OD, feel like overdosing\n[01:33.66]Lowkey I been looking for the signs\n[01:36.60]But all I can find is a sign of the times\n[Chorus]\n[01:39.50]From the unknown\n[01:42.40]I ran away, I don't think I'm coming back home\n[01:46.08]Woah-woah-woah-woah-woah-woah\n[01:48.76]Like a crawlspace, it's a dark place I roam\n[01:51.84]Ain't no right way, just the wrong way I know\n[01:55.18]I problem-solve with Styrofoam\n[01:58.18]My world revolves around a black hole\n[02:01.30]The same black hole that's in place of my soul, uh\n[02:04.68]Empty, I feel so goddamn empty\n[02:09.08]I may go rogue\n[02:10.52]Do